Art Assets (No Disclosure Required): The explicit use of commercial Synty asset packs guarantees that no generative AI is used for final visual properties.
Text/Lore Generation (Pre-Generated Disclosure Mandatory): Because the seasonal text pipeline runs once, per season, and bakes data directly into static JSON files prior to Godot compilation, the application completely avoids the strict, heavily audited "Live-Generated Content" category.
